oox, sd: a snapshot checks for input between shapes, pictures and masters

Patch 0122's sites showed where a PPTX snapshot ran unchecked: on
t.pptx 46 ms between ppt/presentation.xml and the first slide master,
spent in FindEquivalentMasterPages, which compares every pair of the
deck's twelve masters; Windows measured 100 to 190 ms and keys waited
behind it. The pair loop, ShapeExport::WriteShape and
GraphicExport::writeNewEntryToStorage now call checkSnapshot. The
master pass only reads the document; a stop inside a shape was
already possible from the serializer's flush. On t.pptx the longest
gap falls to 3 ms.
